The '''Lesser Lantillian Route'''<ref name="Galaxy Guide">{{SWYouTube|series=Star Wars: Galaxy Guide|text=Meet the Hutts: The Galaxy's Biggest Crime Lords|video=Ct977noXUVg}}</ref> was a hyperlane that ran from [[Zeltros]] in the [[Inner Rim Territories]]<ref name="Map" /> east to [[Junkfort Station]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]],<ref name="TFABG" /> passing through numerous worlds in both regions as well as the [[Expansion Region]] and [[Mid Rim Territories]] between them.<ref name="Map" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, the Lesser Lantillian Route was first mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

